- Add `text-transform: uppercase` and `letter-spacing: 0.08em` at `font-size: 13px`
- Or go fully minimal: white text, no background, subtle bottom border only

## 7. The bank ticker at top

This is actually one of the best elements — keep it. One small tweak: the font looks like it might be the default sans-serif. Set it explicitly to `"Helvetica Neue"` or `"IBM Plex Sans"` with `letter-spacing: 0.15em` and `font-weight: 400`. Slightly reduce the font size if it's above 12px — smaller reads more premium/understated.

## 8. Form card

The card itself has a subtle border or shadow. Make sure:

- Border: `1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06)` (very faint, not obvious)
- No box-shadow (AI loves adding `box-shadow` to cards)
- Background: `#0E0E0D` (barely lighter than page, warm)
- "INVITE ONLY" label: smaller font, more letter-spacing, warm gray not white

